Independent reproduction in data/curated/econpub.db (read-only). Baselines match m1_quality.md lines 12-20 exactly: content_type='article' = 4,844; is_pp=1 = 1,847 (all articles); authorships joined to content_type='article' = 10,858. Set query:
SELECT paper_id,is_pp FROM papers WHERE content_type='article' AND (lower(title) LIKE '%foreword%' OR lower(title) LIKE '%editor%introduction%' OR lower(title) LIKE 'editor,%' OR lower(title) LIKE '%list of online reports%' OR lower(title) LIKE '%general information on the association%' OR lower(title) LIKE '%john bates clark%' OR lower(title) LIKE '%independent auditor%' OR lower(trim(title)) IN ('american economic review','journal of economic literature','journal of economic perspectives','american economic journal: applied economics','american economic journal: economic policy','american economic journal: macroeconomics','american economic journal: microeconomics'));
returns exactly 53 rows; SUM(is_pp)=52; 0 rows is_duplicate=1; 69 authorships (no duplicate paper_id/author_id pairs). Group counts/slots all verified: 34 Foreword/Editors'/Editor's Introduction (50 slots; 42 such titles overall, 8 already unattributed at 3092,3093,3353,3354,3540,3541,4168,4169), 13 editor/list reports 867,869,912,1593,2520,2792,1595-1601 (13 slots), 3 General Information 1609,1864,2538 (3), 2 John Bates Clark 524,1361 (2), 1 auditor 4942 (1). Arithmetic verified: 4,844-53=4,791; 1,847-52=1,795; 10,858-69=10,789. Examples match raw Crossref pages: 524 10.1257/0002828041302271 (94(2) 477-478, Steven Levitt), 1361 10.1257/aer.98.2.559 (98(2) 559-560, Susan C Athey), 1595 10.1257/aer.99.2.660 (99(2) 660-670, Robert A Moffitt), 1600 10.1257/aer.99.2.681 (Olivier Blanchard), 1609 10.1257/aer.99.2.712 (John Siegfried), 4942 10.1257/aer.112.6.2083 (Cherry Bekaert), 867 10.1257/000282806777211784, 912 10.1257/000282806777212305. Report lines 150-166 do list Foreword 2002-2006 as "non-duplicate research articles", and methodology lines 71/75 define article as research article and claim exclusion of non-research types, so the finding's citations are accurate. No doc states this misclassification, so already_documented=false is correct. Caveat (does not change the count): the evidence's literal title-pattern query omits the exact AER journal-name condition, so it returns 46 rows/45 is_pp/56 slots; the 7 records 1595-1601 are journal-name-titled 2009 editor reports that must be added to reach 53/52/69.
